# L §5.14.1 (round 12): a projection "starts from x's balance at the start of day t (a t before S is a hole,
# HOLE-PRERUN: nothing before S is walked)"; L §8.1 HOLE-PRERUN "before the run's start" (round 12: "or a projection
# starts before it"). (Was REFCORE-UNSPECIFIED §5.14.1, writer 5's T-66.)
=== m.tally
model t
  tally 2
  on 2026-10-18
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

source s "s"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
place konto: accounts PLN lives 2025-01-01..

version v
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  opening[konto] = 10.00 PLN at 2026-01-01 start "s"

ask q: bal(konto, 2026-06-30) from 2025-12-01
ask r: low(konto, 2026-01-01 .. 2026-06-30) from 2025-12-01
=== expect
q: ?"before the run's start" (konto)
  cut 2026-10-18
r: ?"before the run's start" (konto)
  cut 2026-10-18
